  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3HWH60C.png\" alt=\"\"></p><div>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/plasmo-voice\" rel=\"nofollow\">Plasmo Voice</a>\n    <span> | </span>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fplugin%252fpv-addon-soundphysics\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a>\n    <span> | </span>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pv-addon-soundphysics\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curseforge</a>\n    <span> | </span>\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/plasmoapp/pv-addon-soundphysics/\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a>\n    <span> | </span>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fuueEqzwCJJ\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a>\n     <span> | </span>\n    <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/plasmomc\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a>\n</div><h1>pv-addon-soundphysics</h1><p>適用於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/plasmo-voice\" rel=\"nofollow\">Plasmo Voice</a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pv-addon-soundphysics\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sound Physics Remastered</a> 模組的相容性附加元件。</p><p>安裝此附加元件後，Plasmo Voice 將受到 Sound Physics 的影響。</p><h2>安裝步驟</h2><p>支援 Fabric 與 Forge 兩種平台，同一附加元件檔案適用於兩者。</p><ol>\n<li>安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/plasmo-voice\" rel=\"nofollow\">Plasmo Voice</a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sound-physics-remastered\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sound Physics Remastered</a></li>\n<li>從 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pv-addon-soundphysics\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curseforge</a> 下載附加元件</li>\n<li>將其放入 <code>~/mods</code> 資料夾中</li>\n</ol>",
